{
  "$schema": "https://schema.freqtrade.io/schema.json",
  "_comment": "Freqtrade 需要严格 JSON。以 _comment 开头的键会被 Freqtrade 忽略（已用 freqtrade 2026.7 实测通过校验），因此用它内联写审查注释。策略逻辑在 MyStrategy.py，特征输入在 feature_engineering.py，标签与预测读取在 model_io.py。",
  "trading_mode": "futures",
  "margin_mode": "isolated",
  "_comment_position": "全局只允许一个持仓。跨 pair 择优由 MyStrategy.confirm_trade_entry 实现：比较所有 pair 的 abs(预测收益率/近30根波动率)，只允许最强候选成交。",
  "max_open_trades": 1,
  "stake_currency": "USDT",
  "stake_amount": 100,
  "tradable_balance_ratio": 1.0,
  "fiat_display_currency": "USD",
  "dry_run": true,
  "dry_run_wallet": 1000,
  "timeframe": "4h",
  "_comment_exit": "止盈止损已按要求移除：stoploss=-1.0 是把固定止损放到极远位置（Freqtrade 允许的边界值，不是删除订单保护开关），trailing_stop=false 关闭追踪止损，策略内 minimal_roi={\"0\":999.0} 关闭 ROI 止盈。退出只由预测反转和跨 pair 轮换触发。",
  "stoploss": -1.0,
  "trailing_stop": false,
  "fee": 0.0005,
  "datadir": "/home/wangke/project/FreqtradeStratege/data",
  "dataformat_ohlcv": "feather",
  "cancel_open_orders_on_exit": true,
  "unfilledtimeout": {
    "entry": 10,
    "exit": 10,
    "unit": "minutes"
  },
  "entry_pricing": {
    "price_side": "same",
    "use_order_book": true
  },
  "exit_pricing": {
    "price_side": "same",
    "use_order_book": true
  },
  "exchange": {
    "_comment": "binance 合约数据源。key/secret 留空表示 dry-run 不接实盘密钥；pair_whitelist 是 72 个有有效 4h futures 数据的标的，FreqAI 会为每个 pair 独立训练模型。",
    "name": "binance",
    "key": "",
    "secret": "",
    "ccxt_config": {},
    "ccxt_async_config": {
      "aiohttp_trust_env": true,
      "timeout": 120000,
      "enableRateLimit": true
    },
    "pair_whitelist": [
